, per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 7067, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01NhGgCsKawBLAwDaaJSGtQ4", "tool": "commit_changes", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 7067, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01NhGgCsKawBLAwDaaJSGtQ4", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 8288, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Ppd5YV5syudfa5129BBoFZ", "tool": "trigger_ci", "args": {"ref": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding", "idempotency_key": "fin-212-bankers-rounding-08d3cd5986"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 8588, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Ppd5YV5syudfa5129BBoFZ", "tool": "trigger_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "fin-212-bankers-rounding-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 8588, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Ppd5YV5syudfa5129BBoFZ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 9307, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01PS8zFu83gX3nx7vFEdCgfY", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "args": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 368588, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01PS8zFu83gX3nx7vFEdCgfY", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 368588, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01PS8zFu83gX3nx7vFEdCgfY", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 371139, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01D63DDnPmPxZXggfk6HY7Hf", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN (banker's rounding) in round_money per FIN-212", "body": "## Summary\nThe nightly build failed because `tests/test_money.py` expects banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN, per FIN-212), but `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`.\n\nThis PR switches `round_money` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. The function's docstring already described banker's rounding, so this brings the implementation in line with it.\n\n## Verification\n- Test expectations: `2.675 -> 2.68` and `2.665 -> 2.66` (both match half-even).\n- CI run `ci-0001` passed on commit 08d3cd5986.\n\n## Notes\n- Change is limited to one import and one `rounding=` argument in `src/money.py`.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fin-212-bankers-rounding-08d3cd5986"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 372039, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01D63DDnPmPxZXggfk6HY7Hf", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "SEMANTIC_FAILURE", "error_kind": "business_error", "error_message": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding is behind main; update the branch before opening a pull request", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "semantic", "idempotency_key": "pr-fin-212-bankers-rounding-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 372039, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01D63DDnPmPxZXggfk6HY7Hf", "kind": "rejected", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 373625, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01GY2BcjW3uk3PJ5YKguMwdT", "tool": "update_branch", "args": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 374425, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01GY2BcjW3uk3PJ5YKguMwdT", "tool": "update_branch", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false