ions: `2.675 -> 2.68` and `2.665 -> 2.66` (both match half-even).\n- CI run `ci-0001` passed on commit 08d3cd5986.\n\n## Notes\n- Change is limited to one import and one `rounding=` argument in `src/money.py`.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fin-212-bankers-rounding-08d3cd5986"}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The PR was rejected because the branch is behind main. I'll merge the latest main into the branch. That updates my feature branch only, not main, so it's within what I've been asked to do. Since the commit will change, I'll need to re-run CI before opening the PR.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01GY2BcjW3uk3PJ5YKguMwdT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding"}, "name": "update_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01SfFUeTgQCMtPYDTsxcRyZx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py", "ref": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_013ADvhZUcXGFrMVK8xXmSFr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding", "idempotency_key": "fin-212-bankers-rounding-0a9452f727"}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The merged branch still has my fix, and CI is running on the new commit 0a9452f727.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01M4Jv8DeDLGUgqVjZPwmUQK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0002"}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "CI passed on 0a9452f727. Now I'll open the PR.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01AEYQorMZFy9nvYUVhGws37", "caller": {"type": "dir